><span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2.5l2.9 6.6 7.1.6-5.4 4.7 1.6 7-6.2-3.7-6.2 3.7 1.6-7L2 9.7l7.1-.6z\"/></svg></span><span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2.5l2.9 6.6 7.1.6-5.4 4.7 1.6 7-6.2-3.7-6.2 3.7 1.6-7L2 9.7l7.1-.6z\"/></svg></span><span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2.5l2.9 6.6 7.1.6-5.4 4.7 1.6 7-6.2-3.7-6.2 3.7 1.6-7L2 9.7l7.1-.6z\"/></svg></span><span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2.5l2.9 6.6 7.1.6-5.4 4.7 1.6 7-6.2-3.7-6.2 3.7 1.6-7L2 9.7l7.1-.6z\"/></svg></span><span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2.5l2.9 6.6 7.1.6-5.4 4.7 1.6 7-6.2-3.7-6.2 3.7 1.6-7L2 9.7l7.1-.6z\"/></svg></span></div>\n      <div class=\"kicker\">What men say about TryScent</div>\n      <h2 class=\"section-title\">The scent gets noticed. The price doesn't.</h2>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"carousel\" data-ts-carousel>\n      <article class=\"review-card\">\n        <div class=\"review-top\">\n          <div class=\"review-stars\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5 stars\"><span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2.5l2.9 6.6 7.1.6-5.4 4.7 1.6 7-6.2-3.7-6.2 3.7 1.6-7L2 9.7l7.1-.6z\"/></svg></span><span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2.5l2.9 6.6 7.1.6-5.4 4.7 1.6 7-6.2-3.7-6.2 3.7 1.6-7L2 9.7l7.1-.6z\"/></svg></span><span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2.5l2.9 6.6 7.1.6-5.4 4.7 1.6 7-6.2-3.7-6.2 3.7 1.6-7L2 9.7l7.1-.6z\"/></svg></span><span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2.5l2.9 6.6 7.1.6-5.4 4.7 1.6 7-6.2-3.7-6.2 3.7 1.6-7L2 9.7l7.1-.6z\"/></svg></span><span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2.5l2.9 6.6 7.1.6-5.4 4.7 1.6 7-6.2-3.7-6.2 3.7 1.6-7L2 9.7l7.1-.6z\"/></svg></span></div>\n          <a class=\"verified\" href=\"https://se.trustpilot.com/review/tryscent.co\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"tp-dot\">&#9679;</span> Trustpilot review</a>\n        </div>\n        <h3>&#8220;It smells EXACTLY like Dior Homme Intense &#8230; almost scarily similar.&#8221;</h3>\n        <p>The dark, creamy, luxurious character you expect was there from the very first spray.</p>\n        <p class=\"result-line\">The familiar fragrance experience, without the designer price.</p>\n        <div class=\"person\"><strong>Johan Bergstr&#246;m</strong><span>Review on Trustpilot</span></div>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"review-card\">\n        <div class=\"review-top\">\n          <div class=\"review-stars\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5 stars\"><span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2.5l2.9 6.6 7.1.6-5.4 4.7 1.6 7-6.2-3.7-6.2 3.7 1.6-7L2 9.7l7.1-.6z\"/></svg></span><span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2.5l2.9 6.6 7.1.6-5.4 4.7 1.6 7-6.2-3.7-6.2 3.7 1.6-7L2 9.7l7.1-.6z\"/></svg></span><span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2.5l2.9 6.6 7.1.6-5.4 4.7 1.6 7-6.2-3.7-6.2 3.7 1.6-7L2 9.7l7.1-.6z\"/></svg></span><span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2.5l2.9 6.6 7.1.6-5.4 4.7 1.6 7-6.2-3.7-6.2 3.7 1.6-7L2 9.7l7.1-.6z\"/></svg></span><span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2.5l2.9 6.6 7.1.6-5.4 4.7 1.6 7-6.2-3.7-6.2 3.7 1.6-7L2 9.7l7.1-.6z\"/></svg></span></div>\n          <a class=\"verified\" href=\"https://se.trustpilot.com/review/tryscent.co\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"tp-dot\">&#9679;</span> Trustpilot review</a>\n        </div>\n        <h3>&#8220;Exactly like the one it's inspired by.&#8221;</h3>\n        <p>I've bought perfume for both myself and my wife and they smell really nice. Recommended!</p>\n        <div class=\"person\"><strong>Mattias Eklund</strong><span>Review on Trustpilot</span></div>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"review-card\">\n        <div class=\"review-top\">\n          <div class=\"review-stars\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5 stars\"><span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2.5l2.9 6.6 7.1.6-5.4 4.7 1.6 7-6.2-3.7-6.2 3.7 1.6-7L2 9.7l7.1-.6z\"/></svg></span><span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2.5l2.9 6.6 7.1.6-5.4 4.7 1.6 7-6.2-3.7-6.2 3.7 1.6-7L2 9.7l7.1-.6z\"/></svg></span><span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2.5l2.9 6.6 7.1.6-5.4 4.7 1.6 7-6.2-3.7-6.2 3.7 1.6-7L2 9.7l7.1-.6z\"/></svg></span><span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2.5l2.9 6.6 7.1.6-5.4 4.7 1.6 7-6.2-3.7-6.2 3.7 1.6-7L2 9.7l7.1-.6z\"/></svg></span><span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2.5l2.9 6.6 7.1.6-5.4 4.7 1.6 7-6.2-3.7-6.2 3.7 1.6-7L2 9.7l7.1-.6z\"/></svg></span></div>\n          <a class=\"verified\" href=\"https://se.trustpilot.com/review/tryscent.co\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"tp-dot\">&#9679;</span> Trustpilot review</a>\n        </div>\n        <h3>&#8220;It smelled just like the original.&#8221;</h3>\n        <p>Tried it and got it delivered this week. Immediately ordered 6 more.</p>\n        <div class=\"person\"><strong>Anders</strong><span>Review on Trustpilot</span></div>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"review-card\">\n        <div class=\"review-top\">\n          <div class=\"review-stars\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5 stars\"><span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2.5l2.9 6.6 7.1.6-5.4 4.7 1.6 7-6.2-3.7-6.2 3.7 1.6-7L2 9.7l7.1-.6z\"/></svg></span><span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2.5l2.9 6.6 7.1.6-5.4 4.7 1.6 7-6.2-3.7-6.2 3.7 1.6-7L2 9.7l7.1-.6z\"/></svg></span><span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2.5l2.9 6.6 7.1.6-5.4 4.7 1.6 7-6.2-3.7-6.2 3.7 1.6-7L2 9.7l7.1-.6z\"/></svg></span><span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2.5l2.9 6.6 7.1.6-5.4 4.7 1.6 7-6.2-3.7-6.2 3.7 1.6-7L2 9.7l7.1-.6z\"/></svg></span><span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2.5l2.9 6.6 7.1.6-5.4 4.7 1.6 7-6.2-3.7-6.2 3.7 1.6-7L2 9.7l7.1-.6z\"/></svg></span></div>\n          <a class=\"verified\" href=\"https://se.trustpilot.com/review/tryscent.co\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"tp-dot\">&#9679;</span> Trustpilot review</a>\n        </div>\n        <h3>&#8220;They all smell identical to the original.&#8221;</h3>\n        <p>Just got my 5 perfumes. Happy with what you get for the price, well done!</p>\n        <div class=\"person\"><strong>Olle Pettersson</strong><span>Review on Trustpilot</span></div>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"review-card\">\n        <div class=\"review-top\">\n          <div class=\"review-stars\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5 stars\"><span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2.5l2.9 6.6 7.1.6-5.4 4.7 1.6 7-6.2-3.7-6.2 3.7 1.6-7L2 9.7l7.1-.6z\"/></svg></span><span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2.5l2.9 6.6 7.1.6-5.4 4.7 1.6 7-6.2-3.7-6.2 3.7 1.6-7L2 9.7l7.1-.6z\"/></svg></span><span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2.5l2.9 6.6 7.1.6-5.4 4.7 1.6 7-6.2-3.7-6.2 3.7 1.6-7L2 9.7l7.1-.6z\"/></svg></span><span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2.5l2.9 6.6 7.1.6-5.4 4.7 1.6 7-6.2-3.7-6.2 3.7 1.6-7L2 9.7l7.1-.6z\"/></svg></span><span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2.5l2.9 6.6 7.1.6-5.4 4.7 1.6 7-6.2-3.7-6.2 3.7 1.6-7L2 9.7l7.1-.6z\"/></svg></span></div>\n          <a class=\"verified\" href=\"https://se.trustpilot.com/review/tryscent.co\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"tp-dot\">&#9679;</span> Trustpilot review</a>\n        </div>\n        <h3>&#8220;From my experience with perfumes, this is quality &#128175;&#8221;</h3>\n        <p>Very good perfumes and they're worth the price I have to say.</p>\n        <div class=\"person\"><strong>Jesper Frykholm</strong><span>Review on Trustpilot</span></div>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"review-card\">\n        <div class=\"review-top\">\n          <div class=\"review-stars\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5 stars\"><span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2.5l2.9 6.6 7.1.6-5.4 4.7 1.6 7-6.2-3.7-6.2 3.7 1.6-7L2 9.7l7.1-.6z\"/></svg></span><span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2.5l2.9 6.6 7.1.6-5.4 4.7 1.6 7-6.2-3.7-6.2 3.7 1.6-7L2 9.7l7.1-.6z\"/></svg></span><span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2.5l2.9 6.6 7.1.6-5.4 4.7 1.6 7-6.2-3.7-6.2 3.7 1.6-7L2 9.7l7.1-.6z\"/></svg></span><span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2.5l2.9 6.6 7.1.6-5.4 4.7 1.6 7-6.2-3.7-6.2 3.7 1.6-7L2 9.7l7.1-.6z\"/></svg></span><span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2.5l2.9 6.6 7.1.6-5.4 4.7 1.6 7-6.2-3.7-6.2 3.7 1.6-7L2 9.7l7.1-.6z\"/></svg></span></div>\n          <a class=\"verified\" href=\"https://se.trustpilot.com/review/tryscent.co\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"tp-dot\">&#9679;</span> Trustpilot review</a>\n        </div>\n        <h3>&#8220;Perfect for evenings, dates and when you want to make a strong impression.&#8221;</h3>\n        <p>If the goal is for people to ask &#8220;What perfume are you wearing?&#8221;, I'd personally pick Midnight Oud &#8211; No. 286M or Wild Rebel &#8211; No. 232.</p>\n        <div class=\"person\"><strong>Mohammad Al_Najjar</strong><span>Review on Trustpilot</span></div>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"review-card\">\n        <div class=\"review-top\">\n          <div class=\"review-stars\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"4 out of 5 stars\"><span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2.5l2.9 6.6 7.1.6-5.4 4.7 1.6 7-6.2-3.7-6.2 3.7 1.6-7L2 9.7l7.1-.6z\"/></svg></span><span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2.5l2.9 6.6 7.1.6-5.4 4.7 1.6 7-6.2-3.7-6.2 3.7 1.6-7L2 9.7l7.1-.6z\"/></svg></span><span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2.5l2.9 6.6 7.1.6-5.4 4.7 1.6 7-6.2-3.7-6.2 3.7 1.6-7L2 9.7l7.1-.6z\"/></svg></span><span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2.5l2.9 6.6 7.1.6-5.4 4.7 1.6 7-6.2-3.7-6.2 3.7 1.6-7L2 9.7l7.1-.6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"off\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2.5l2.9 6.6 7.1.6-5.4 4.7 1.6 7-6.2-3.7-6.2 3.7 1.6-7L2 9.7l7.1-.6z\"/></svg></span></div>\n          <a class=\"verified\" href=\"https://se.trustpilot.com/review/tryscent.co\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"tp-dot\">&#9679;</span> Trustpilot review</a>\n        </div>\n        <h3>&#8220;Luxurious, deep scents without paying too much.&#8221;</h3>\n        <p>The perfumes smell exclusive and the best part is they last incredibly long &#8211; both on the skin and in your clothes.</p>\n        <div class=\"person\"><strong>Hassan Alzoubi</strong><span>Review on Trustpilot</span></div>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"review-card\">\n        <div class=\"review-top\">\n          <div class=\"review-stars\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5 stars\"><span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2.5l2.9 6.6 7.1.6-5.4 4.7 1.6 7-6.2-3.7-6.2 3.7 1.6-7L2 9.7l7.1-.6z\"/></svg></span><span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2.5l2.9 6.6 7.1.6-5.4 4.7 1.6 7-6.2-3.7-6.2 3.7 1.6-7L2 9.7l7.1-.6z\"/></svg></span><span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2.5l2.9 6.6 7.1.6-5.4 4.7 1.6 7-6.2-3.7-6.2 3.7 1.6-7L2 9.7l7.1-.6z\"/></svg></span><span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2.5l2.9 6.6 7.1.6-5.4 4.7 1.6 7-6.2-3.7-6.2 3.7 1.6-7L2 9.7l7.1-.6z\"/></svg></span><span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2.5l2.9 6.6 7.1.6-5.4 4.7 1.6 7-6.2-3.7-6.2 3.7 1.6-7L2 9.7l7.1-.6z\"/></svg></span></div>\n          <a class=\"verified\" href=\"https://se.trustpilot.com/review/tryscent.co\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"tp-dot\">&#9679;</span> Trustpilot review</a>\n        </div>\n        <h3>&#8220;At first I was skeptical &#8230;&#8221;</h3>\n        <p>But when I placed my first order I discovered the perfumes are amazing and very similar to the original perfumes. The price is also really, really good. I'll definitely keep shopping from TryScent in the future.</p>\n        <div class=\"person\"><strong>Ahmad Ismail</strong><span>Review on Trustpilot</span></div>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"review-card\">\n        <div class=\"review-top\">\n          <div class=\"review-stars\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"4 out of 5 stars\"><span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2.5l2.9 6.6 7.1.6-5.4 4.7 1.6 7-6.2-3.7-6.2 3.7 1.6-7L2 9.7l7.1-.6z\"/></svg></span><span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2.5l2.9 6.6 7.1.6-5.4 4.7 1.6 7-6.2-3.7-6.2 3.7 1.6-7L2 9.7l7.1-.6z\"/></svg></span><span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2.5l2.9 6.6 7.1.6-5.4 4.7 1.6 7-6.2-3.7-6.2 3.7 1.6-7L2 9.7l7.1-.6z\"/></svg></span><span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2.5l2.9 6.6 7.1.6-5.4 4.7 1.6 7-6.2-3.7-6.2 3.7 1.6-7L2 9.7l7.1-.6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"off\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2.5l2.9 6.6 7.1.6-5.4 4.7 1.6 7-6.2-3.7-6.2 3.7 1.6-7L2 9.7l7.1-.6z\"/></svg></span></div>\n          <a class=\"verified\" href=\"https://se.trustpilot.com/review/tryscent.co\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"tp-dot\">&#9679;</span> Trustpilot review</a>\n        </div>\n        <h3>&#8220;Smells exactly like the original.&#8221;</h3>\n        <p>Such good prices. Why pay over 1000 kr for one perfume when you can buy several